Scenario ethereum

Given I have the 'keyring'
Given I have a 'gas price'
Given I have a 'gas limit'
Given I have a 'ethereum nonce'
Given I have a 'string' named 'depth'
Given I have a 'string' named 'num_root'
Given I have a 'string' named 'nullifier'
Given I have a 'string' named 'message'
Given I have a 'string array' named 'points'
Given I have a 'ethereum address' named 'contract_address'

When I create ethereum transaction to 'contract_address'
When I use ethereum transaction to validate membership with merkle tree depth 'depth' and root 'num_root' and nullifier 'nullifier' and message 'message' and points 'points'
When I create signed ethereum transaction for chain '222'

Then print 'signed ethereum transaction'